Notebook[{
Cell["Z_n anyons: when does the hexagon equation hold?","Title"],
Cell["Operadica の最小の例。Z_n 上の pointed braided category ZNAnyons[n, p] を、五角形・六角形等式の成否と「スピン」の図として見る。Examples フォルダに置いたまま上から順に評価する。","Text"],
Cell["0. Load","Section"],
Cell["PacletDirectoryLoad[ParentDirectory[NotebookDirectory[]]];\nNeeds[\"Operadica`\"];","Input"],
Cell["読み込めないときは、README の読み込み方法に合わせて上の行を書き換える。","Text"],
Cell["1. Which (n, p) are braided?","Section"],
Cell["ZNAnyons[n, p] は Z_n の対象に、3-cocycle(結合子)と braiding を p で指定した圏。p は 2n を周期とする。五角形と六角形の両方が通る所を緑、通らない所を赤で示す。","Text"],
Cell["ns = Range[2, 8]; ps = Range[0, 15];\nbraided = Table[PentagonQ[ZNAnyons[n, p]] && HexagonQ[ZNAnyons[n, p]], {n, ns}, {p, ps}];\nArrayPlot[Boole[braided], ColorRules -> {0 -> RGBColor[0.9, 0.5, 0.5], 1 -> RGBColor[0.55, 0.8, 0.55]},\n  Mesh -> True, DataReversed -> True, ImageSize -> 450,\n  FrameLabel -> {\"p\", \"n\"},\n  FrameTicks -> {{MapIndexed[{First[#2], #1} &, ns], None}, {MapIndexed[{First[#2], #1} &, ps], None}}]","Input"],
Cell["読み取り: n が偶数ならどの p でも通る。n が奇数なら p が偶数のときだけ通る。(テストでも確認している規則。)","Text"],
Cell["2. E_n level","Section"],
Cell["EnLevel: 0 = monoidal でもない(braiding なし)、2 = braided、Infinity = symmetric。","Text"],
Cell["levels = Table[EnLevel[ZNAnyons[n, p]], {n, 2, 6}, {p, 0, 7}];\nGrid[Prepend[MapIndexed[Prepend[#1, \"n=\" <> ToString[First[#2] + 1]] &, levels],\n   Prepend[Range[0, 7], \"p\"]],\n  Background -> {None, None, Flatten[Table[{i + 1, j + 1} -> Switch[levels[[i, j]], 0, LightRed, 2, LightYellow, _, LightGreen], {i, 5}, {j, 8}]]},\n  Frame -> All, Spacings -> {1, 0.8}]","Input"],
Cell["3. The spin on the unit circle","Section"],
Cell["各対象 a のトポロジカルスピン θ(a) ∈ Q/Z を、単位円上の角度 2πθ の点として描く。n, p を動かして見る。","Text"],
Cell["Manipulate[\n  With[{cat = ZNAnyons[n, p]},\n    If[! (PentagonQ[cat] && HexagonQ[cat]),\n      Style[\"not braided\", Red, 16],\n      With[{tab = Normal[SpinTable[cat]]},\n        Graphics[{Gray, Circle[],\n          Table[With[{ang = 2 Pi N[tab[[k, 2]]]},\n            {Blue, PointSize[0.03], Point[{Cos[ang], Sin[ang]}],\n             Black, Text[tab[[k, 1, 1]], 1.18 {Cos[ang], Sin[ang]}]}], {k, Length[tab]}]},\n          ImageSize -> 300, PlotRange -> 1.4]]]],\n  {{n, 4}, 2, 8, 1}, {{p, 1}, 0, 15, 1}]","Input"],
Cell["n = 4, p = 1 では 4 つの対象が 0, 1/8, 1/2, 1/8 の位置に並ぶ。p = 3 では 1/8 が 3/8 に移る。","Text"],
Cell["4. Modularity and the Mueger center","Section"],
Cell["modular = Mueger center が自明(対象は単位だけ)。","Text"],
Cell["mod = Table[ModularQ[ZNAnyons[n, p]], {n, 2, 6}, {p, {1, 2, 3}}];\nGrid[Prepend[MapIndexed[Prepend[#1, \"n=\" <> ToString[First[#2] + 1]] &, mod], {\"\", \"p=1\", \"p=2\", \"p=3\"}], Frame -> All]","Input"],
Cell["{MugerCenter[ZNAnyons[4, 1]], MugerCenter[ZNAnyons[4, 2]]}","Input"],
Cell["5. How many distinct braided structures?","Section"],
Cell["スピンの表が異なるものを数える。braided は n gcd(2,n) 個、symmetric は gcd(2,n) 個(H^4(K(Z_n,2),U(1)), H^5(K(Z_n,3),U(1)) の位数)。","Text"],
Cell["count[n_] := With[{valid = Select[Range[0, 2 n - 1], EvenQ[n] || EvenQ[#] &]},\n  {n, Length[Union[Map[Values[SpinTable[ZNAnyons[n, #]]] &, valid]]],\n      Length[Union[Map[Values[SpinTable[ZNAnyons[n, #]]] &, Select[valid, SymmetricBraidingQ[ZNAnyons[n, #]] &]]]]}];\nGrid[Prepend[Table[count[n], {n, 2, 6}], {\"n\", \"braided\", \"symmetric\"}], Frame -> All]","Input"]
}]
